## References (no code or assets included)

These projects are not part of Clackwise: no code, resources or assets from them are copied or adapted.
Clackwise reads the motion sensor with its own code, written from facts about the interface (the SPU
driver's property names, the vendor usage page and usage of the accelerometer, the 22-byte report layout
and its fixed-point scale), which these projects documented. They are listed to credit that research.

- https://github.com/olvvier/apple-silicon-accelerometer: MIT, © 2026 olvvier. Documents how to read the
  accelerometer on the Apple Silicon sensor processing unit.
- https://github.com/posthog/meepslap: no license file and no license grant (its README says "MIT" but
  names no copyright holder). Its accelerometer reader is credited there to
  https://github.com/AbdullahFID/MacSlapApp, which has no license either. Neither is used as a source of
  code.
